+twice. Their named tests failed with subprocess exit 1 on both runs. The
+line-count-preserving C-control survived as expected. Rev5's 355-row full
+harness evidence remains valid for its unchanged plants, but the rev6 harness
+has 357 rows and was not run as a complete pass.
